OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Flight rain persisting at first this
OL,7,Fevening with rain gradually clearing
OL,8,Fto the north. Remaining cloudy
OL,9,Fovernight, which may be low enough to
OL,10,Fcreate some hill fog, with the
OL,11,Fpotential for the odd spot of drizzle.
OL,12,FStaying mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA drier and brighter day on
OL,15,FThursday, with some spells of
OL,16,Fsunshine, especially throughout the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Feeling warm and rather
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
