OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWet and
OL,6,Fcloudy at first on Friday, with rain
OL,7,Fclearing southwards and brighter
OL,8,Fweather following. Saturday looks
OL,9,Fsettled, before a bright, breezy and
OL,10,Fpotentially warm Sunday.
